              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchanïn ECHOTYON, “Wïyö ngat chama korkengu nyo kaporesan nko mïrön nyo pïrchini nyinte. Icham nyinte le wölini ochömtonan pipö Israel, kïrkegh köwöghökisyö chane akïrïp tororötin walaka akïropchï ropöw körkeyïntinekwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kyoyokwan korkenyan ompö ropïyeni silpa cho le taman nko mut nko kilen 150 cho pö matay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay olenchan nyinte, “Itöponyi osis cho chang amegh cheporesnan anta ilïkwï koko chi anka tïkwïl, alïkwan nyu tïkwïl nyo ghanat ompö nyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo tïpisot pipö Israel osis cho chang kïpuryö pöytoghï anta kintöghoghï, kïpuryö amörostin anta pchörin anta körkeyïntin anta epod* chepkweghyon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo söromunyi kimïlisyö ngat pipö Israel akïyar ECHOTYON Tororötïngwa kïmi nko pöytoghin nyo pö ara Daudi. Atolapay kïrïp chane ECHOTYON akïkonyït nyinte atökïtöpö poropchenyi nko chane ompö osis cho tökïpkonöy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kïgh nyo rwokyinegho ECHOTYON pipö Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
